{"4163660":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Gun a Rat","steam_appid":4163660,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4957770],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun a Rat<\/strong> is a fast-paced asymmetrical multiplayer game to play with your friends.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the <strong>Rats<\/strong> and wreck the house... or as the <strong>Exterminator<\/strong>, and wipe them out down to the last one.<br>Start matches from 2 to 20 players on a variety of maps, each with its own share of surprises, with <strong>3 game modes<\/strong> to choose from…<\/p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A very special voice chat...<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rats<\/strong> can talk to each other through voice chat without fear of being understood.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Exterminator<\/strong> only hears squeaks instead of their words!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.poster.avif?t=1792792863\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.webm?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.mp4?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your goal as a Rat:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the target score by destroying and stealing objects before time runs out, without getting killed!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful... every destruction makes a noise that will give you away!<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.poster.avif?t=1792792863\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.webm?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.mp4?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the <strong>Exterminator<\/strong> is hunting you down,<br>quickly hide in the furniture to escape their gaze.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.poster.avif?t=1792792863\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.webm?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.mp4?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the Exterminator:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>camera<\/strong> to track the rats' movements and find out where they're hiding...<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your <strong>traps<\/strong> carefully to slow them down as much as possible<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill<\/strong> them all!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.poster.avif?t=1792792863\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.webm?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.mp4?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of traps is at your disposal,<br>each one holding its own nasty surprises for the <strong>Rats<\/strong>...<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.poster.avif?t=1792792863\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.webm?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.mp4?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 game modes to keep things fresh:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic<\/strong>: smash and steal as many objects as you can to reach the target score before time runs out!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide and Seek<\/strong>: earn points by looking at the <strong>Exterminator<\/strong>... but stay well hidden so you don't get spotted!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomb Tag<\/strong>: an explosive game of tag! Pass the bomb to another player before it blows up in your snout!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play match after match to earn <strong>Cheese Coins<\/strong>,<br>and spend them on skins to customize your rat!<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.poster.avif?t=1792792863\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.webm?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.mp4?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, which side will you be on?<\/strong><\/p><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun a Rat<\/strong> is a fast-paced asymmetrical multiplayer game to play with your friends.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the <strong>Rats<\/strong> and wreck the house... or as the <strong>Exterminator<\/strong>, and wipe them out down to the last one.<br>Start matches from 2 to 20 players on a variety of maps, each with its own share of surprises, with <strong>3 game modes<\/strong> to choose from…<\/p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A very special voice chat...<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rats<\/strong> can talk to each other through voice chat without fear of being understood.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Exterminator<\/strong> only hears squeaks instead of their words!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.poster.avif?t=1792792863\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"h