https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.mp4?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the Exterminator:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>camera<\/strong> to track the rats' movements and find out where they're hiding...<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your <strong>traps<\/strong> carefully to slow them down as much as possible<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill<\/strong> them all!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.poster.avif?t=1792792863\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.webm?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.mp4?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of traps is at your disposal,<br>each one holding its own nasty surprises for the <strong>Rats<\/strong>...<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.poster.avif?t=1792792863\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.webm?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.mp4?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 game modes to keep things fresh:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic<\/strong>: smash and steal as many objects as you can to reach the target score before time runs out!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide and Seek<\/strong>: earn points by looking at the <strong>Exterminator<\/strong>... but stay well hidden so you don't get spotted!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomb Tag<\/strong>: an explosive game of tag! Pass the bomb to another player before it blows up in your snout!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play match after match to earn <strong>Cheese Coins<\/strong>,<br>and spend them on skins to customize your rat!<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.poster.avif?t=1792792863\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.webm?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/extras\/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.mp4?t=1792792863\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, which side will you be on?<\/strong><\/p><\/p>","short_description":"Don’t like rats? Don’t like your friends? Then this game is made for you! Hunt down the rats before they wreck the place, and methodically place your traps to slow them down as much as possible!","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Bulgarian, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Danish, Spanish - Latin America, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Norwegian, Dutch, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Swedish, Czech, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/aa39a7490dc4102dd54e41efa27ade3a99dca444\/header.jpg?t=1792792863","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/035f002fa7efa063bf1f9f5f039432546f5de2d9\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792792863","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4163660\/035f002fa7efa063bf1f9f5f039432546f5de2d9\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792792863","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10+<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 3 Ghz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GTX 860<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10+<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 3 Ghz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GTX 1060<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[]}}}